{{!--
  App design contract, saved as DESIGN.md at the app root (or the frontend root for several apps).
  Use only when the app has no DESIGN.md. Never reformat an existing DESIGN.md with this template.
  Context:
    appName: product name as users see it
    principles: optional list of { title, rule, owner, date, reference }; only principles the user
      states, with the owner and date they give; never invent or infer them; reference is an issue
      or decision link, or "none"
    surfaces: list of { name, rules }; one entry per part of the product (app shell, home, a
      workflow, a grid); rules is a list of plain-language rules for that surface
    navigationModel: optional; one of "None", "Tabs", "Sidemenu"
    navigationReason: required when navigationModel is set; short rationale for the chosen model
    navigationRevisitWhen: required when navigationModel is set; condition that reopens the
      navigation decision, for example "more than 5 views, sub-navigation, or an unrelated section"
      for tabs, or "a second page or section is added" when navigationModel is "None"
    layoutDecisions: optional list of { page, pageType, pattern, maxWidth, revisitWhen }; pattern is
      one of "A — Centered", "B — Full-width", "C — Viewport-fill"; revisitWhen is the change that
      reopens the decision, for example "a data grid becomes the main content"
    deviations: optional list of { rule, deviation, reason }; departures from fusion-design defaults
    decisions: optional list of { title, link }; design decision records with evidence
    openQuestions: optional list of cases no rule covered and the choice made meanwhile
--}}
